# Raw rendered DOM dumps from capture.mjs — ~4MB of minified WordPress markup
# across the captures, which is neither lightweight nor useful for review. The
# extracted copy lives in rendered.txt and meta.json (both committed), and the
# conclusions in content-intake-summary.md. Re-create with capture.mjs.
workflows/01-content-intake/.tmp/**/rendered.html

# Responsive QA captures — ~7MB of PNGs per run, regenerate with screens.mjs
workflows/08-qa/.tmp/screenshots/

# Vendored GSAP 3.13. Third-party library, not our source, and not tracked
# anywhere else in this repo. Restore with:
#   node workflows/04-design/.tmp/shared/fetch-gsap.mjs
workflows/04-design/.tmp/_vendor/
